    "content": "🍃🌱🍀 This is a charming café surrounded by plenty of trees, making it a cozy place to relax. I came during the heatwave, so even though the area was shaded, it still felt quite hot; but later in the afternoon, just before I left, a light rain came down and made the atmosphere much more refreshing. I ordered Pisang Goreng Nusantara, Kopi Jati (cold), Hot Coffee Latte, and Hot Lemon Tea—everything tasted really good and satisfying. I also noticed there&#39;s a meeting room on the upper floor, which is a nice addition, though the wooden structure feels a bit fragile. When walking around, the floor tends to move slightly thus feels less stable. The service was decent and standard. Overall, it’s a comfortable place with a unique ambiance, and I will definitely be back 👍",
